  "_comment": [
    "The composter's shell, unchanged: a 2px floor and four 2px walls, leaving a 12x12 well open at",
    "the top. The only difference is what the inside face is — a canvas screen rather than a plank",
    "bottom, because the screen is the whole point of the block and the open top is the only place",
    "it can be seen.",
    "",
    "Hand-written rather than datagen'd for the same reason the two machines are: no model provider",
    "expresses a five-element shell, and the blockstate that goes with it is multipart."
